From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winegstreamer: audio resampler IMediaObject, IPropertyBag, IPropertyStore, IWMResamplerProps, MFT status and messages (shared DMO helpers in dmo_transform.c)

The resampler's IMediaObject interface was stubbed with FIXME / E_NOTIMPL.
It now follows the DirectX Media Object rules, mapped onto the object's
IMFTransform:

- GetStreamCount (E_POINTER, untouched outputs), GetInput/OutputStreamInfo
  (flags 0, DMO_E_INVALIDSTREAMINDEX), GetInput/OutputType (types in the
  transform's order, DMO_E_NO_MORE_ITEMS past the end, S_OK for a NULL
  pointer, types without a format block until a format is chosen),
  SetInput/OutputType (DMO_SET_TYPEF_TEST_ONLY and _CLEAR, E_POINTER for NULL,
  E_INVALIDARG for unknown flags, DMO_E_TYPE_NOT_ACCEPTED, the output type
  needs an input type first: DMO_E_TYPE_NOT_SET), GetInput/OutputCurrentType,
  Get{Input,Output}SizeInfo (DMO_E_TYPE_NOT_SET until both types are set).
- Max latency stored per object, Lock holds the object's mutex until
  Lock(FALSE) (calls from other threads wait), Allocate/FreeStreamingResources,
  GetInputStatus (DMO_INPUT_STATUSF_ACCEPT_DATA from the transform),
  Discontinuity (drains), Flush, ProcessInput (DMO_E_NOTACCEPTING),
  ProcessOutput (S_FALSE when there is no output, one output buffer,
  DMO_PROCESS_OUTPUT_DISCARD_WHEN_NO_BUFFER, time stamp / length / INCOMPLETE
  flags).
- IMFTransform: SetInputType / SetOutputType accept NULL to clear, GetInputStatus,
  the DRAIN / FLUSH / streaming notification messages, ProcessEvent and
  GetOutputStatus are the documented E_NOTIMPL without a FIXME. Draining
  makes the last output sample appear (the conformance test expected 12
  output samples).
- IPropertyBag and IPropertyStore keep what is written (names are case
  insensitive, values are converted to the type asked); a missing property
  reads E_INVALIDARG / VT_EMPTY. IWMResamplerProps: SetHalfFilterLength
  range 1..60, SetUserChannelMtx E_POINTER for NULL.
- The helpers shared with the color converter and the WMA decoder are in the
  new dmo_transform.c (this patch), used by patches 2881 and 2882.

mf transform.c: the resampler's "12 output samples" todo_wine is gone; the
last drained sample differs from the reference by one frame in length,
time and duration and lacks the incomplete attribute, marked todo.

---
